==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool 99 MILLION downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF0000|'''On between February 24th (11:00am) and March 10th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''・A Helping Hand for Beginners: Progression Pack on sale!'''}}<br>
A new set of items picked especially for helping with progressing through more challenging stages, including Leadership, Cat Tickets, and other items for use in battle is now on sale!

※ The Progression Pack can only be purchased once.<br>
※ If the Progression Pack is not appearing for sale, please update to the latest version of the Battle Cats.

{{Color|#FF9900|'''・Easier than ever upgrading during the 1/2 XP Campaign!'''}}<br>
During {{Color|#FF0000|'''Friday, Saturday, and Sunday,'''}} {{Color|#0000FF|'''units can be levelled up for 1/2 of their normal cost!'''}}

※ Halved XP costs are indicated by blue text during this campaign. If the half XP costs are not available, please return to the Cat Base and try again.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Treasure Festivals Everyday!'''}}<br>
{{Color|#FF9900|'''During this event, get increased Treasure Drop Rates'''}} in Story Mode chapters for a special Treasure Festival, all day every day!<br>
On {{Color|#38761D|'''even days'''}} visit {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Empire of Cats'''}}, and on {{Color|#00CCFF|'''odd days'''}} head to {{Color|#00CCFF|'''Into the Future'''}} to take advantage of this special event!<br>
Plus, don't miss the Treasure Festival for {{Color|#FF00FF|'''Cats of the Cosmos'''}} on {{Color|#0000FF|'''2/25, 2/28, 3/3, 3/6, 3/9!'''}}

※Please note: Treasure Festivals for Empire of Cats and Into the Future will appear only once Empire of Cats Ch. 1 has been cleared. The Treasure Festival for Cats of the Cosmos will appear once Into the Future Ch. 1 has been cleared.

{{Color|#FF6D01|'''●Cat Food rewards every day!'''}}<br>
Limited-time log-in stamps on now!<br>
Log in during this limited-time event to earn up to {{Color|#FF0000|'''280 Cat Food'''}} every day! Don't forget to grab your free items!

※There are 14 stamps available during this event.<br>
※Update to the latest version of The Battle Cats to access the log-in stamps.

